BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d2aa4bb820267588@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260920T104112Z
DTSTART:20260924T123000Z
DTEND:20260924T143000Z
SUMMARY:As the French Say — The Little Prince
LOCATION:Library\, Alliance Française de Delhi\, 72 Lodhi Estate\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://afdelhi.org/events/as-the-french-say-the-little-prince/
DESCRIPTION:Alliance Française de Delhi’s Book club\, As the French Sa
 y\, opens its first edition with one of the world’s most beloved litera
 ry classics: The Little Prince by Antoine de Saint-Exupéry.\nWhat makes 
 this little book so timeless? Why does The Little Prince continue to spea
 k to readers of all ages\, across languages and generations?\nIn this fir
 st edition of our French literature book club in Delhi\, we explore the p
 hilosophy hidden within the simplicity of Saint-Exupéry’s story. Throu
 gh a journey among stars and planets\, The Little Prince invites us to re
 flect on love\, friendship\, loneliness\, wonder\, growing up\, and the i
 mportance of seeing the world with curiosity.\nWhether you are discoverin
 g The Little Prince for the first time or returning to a story you have l
 oved for years\, this is an opportunity to look at the book from a new pe
 rspective and share your thoughts with fellow book lovers and readers of 
 French literature.\n\n“Well\, I must endure the presence of a few cater
 pillars if I wish to become acquainted with the butterflies.”\n\nCome r
 ead between the stars with us\, revisit a familiar story\, and discover t
 he questions it leaves behind.\n\nEvent Details\nDate: 24 September 2026\
 nTime: 6 PM\nVenue: Library\, Alliance Française de Delhi\nRegister Here
 : https://forms.gle/GqDiceGJC5AtkK3E7\n\nCome for the book. Stay for the 
 questions it leaves behind.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nhttps://afdelhi.org/
 events/as-the-french-say-the-little-prince/
CATEGORIES:other\,literature
END:VEVENT
